            <description>Digital Edge (Singapore) Holdings Pte. Ltd. ("Digital Edge"), one of Asia's fastest-growing data center platforms backed by global infrastructure investor Stonepeak, today announced the successful close of an IDR 5.5 trillion (USD 325 million) corporate facility from PT Bank Central Asia Tbk (BCA).</description>
